ge 51, the recitative between No. 7 and No. 8 (8 bars)","author":"Kurt Soldan (1891–1946), piano reduction","licence":"Public domain","notes":"Written out from the printed pages: sung lines and piano each read by two independent readers, every disagreement settled on the page by a judge, then checked bar by bar by a fresh checker (clean). Where the print gives a second rhythm for the German words, the Italian rhythm is kept. The German singing translation is left out. Playback tempo ♩ = 83, a nominal speaking pace for secco recitative, from Böhm's recording (0:23); Mozart gives no tempo."},{"item":"IPA, gloss and translation","source":"Written for this app (from the app's reviewed Così libretto drafts)","author":"Counterpart development team","licence":"CC0 1.0","notes":"Unreviewed by a diction coach."}],"files":{"musicxml":"score.musicxml","language":"language.json"},"importedAt":"2026-11-12T13:35:37.982Z"}